1. Go to "source_file" folder to compile library 

2. Go to "water_lib" folder to compile library for WHBB water potential
   cd water_lib
   cd 2-body
   cd pes
   ./mke
   cd ..
   cd dms
   ./mke
   cd ..
   cp pes/libpes2b.a dms/libdms2b.a ../../../lib/watlib
   cd ..
   cd 3-body 
   make
   cp -r libpes3b.a mod3b ../../../lib/watlib
   cd ../..
3. Go to "pes_lib" folder to compile library for PES library
   cd pes_lib
   cd inv
   make
   cd ..
   cd pes-xyz
   make
   cp libpes.a libpx.a ..
   cd ..
   cp -r libpes.a libpx.a mod ../../lib/pes_lib

4. Now, the library file has been prepared. 
   To check the file, go to "lib" folder in the main directory. 
   Under "lib" folder, the contained "wat_lib" folder should have updated "libdms2b.a", "libpes2b.a", "libpes3b.a" and "mod3d"
   the contained "pes_lib" folder should have "libpes.a" "libpx.a" and "mod"

5. Refer to "README" file to compile the PES and run the code
